<%
  // Page: Login (spectsEccomerce/pages/login.page.png, spec §4.4).
  // Blocks: teal full-width band on top + centered white card overlapping it;
  // card holds the title "¡Hola!", two inputs (usuario/contraseña), the
  // "Iniciar Sesión" submit and — below the card — the register link.
  //
  // Deviations documented per spec:
  // - §4.4 "Desajuste a resolver": the mockup copy says "Tu nombre de
  //   usuario" but the users table has no username column → the input keeps
  //   the visible copy but is type="email" name="email" inside.
  // - Submit uses .btn-primary (teal) though the mockup paints the button
  //   graphite — spec §4.4 calls it "botón primario" and the user-approved
  //   Paso 6 precedent (cart "Ir a Pagar") normalizes mockup graphite
  //   primaries to the .btn-primary class.
  // - No client validation on login at this paso (spec §6.3 only covers the
  //   register form).
  // - Auth backend does NOT exist yet (checklist line 136: "no hay que
  //   construir auth en este alcance"). The form keeps a placeholder
  //   action="/login" POST per §6.3 ("un POST normal con redirect") — wiring
  //   a real endpoint is a later paso.
%>
<section class="relative">
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-64 bg-brand md:h-72" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-sm px-4 pb-20 pt-10 md:pt-14">
    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-md md:p-8">
      <h1 class="text-h3 text-ink">¡Hola!</h1>

      <form action="/login" method="POST" class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-4">
        <%- include("../atoms/input", {
          name: "email",
          type: "email",
          label: "Email",
          placeholder: "Tu nombre de usuario",
          autocomplete: "email",
        }) %>
        <%- include("../atoms/input", {
          name: "password",
          type: "password",
          label: "Contraseña",
          placeholder: "Tu contraseña",
          autocomplete: "current-password",
        }) %>

        <button type="submit" class="btn-primary mt-2 w-full">Iniciar Sesión</button>
      </form>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-6 text-center text-sm text-ink">
      ¿No tienes cuenta?
      <a href="/register" class="font-bold underline-offset-2 hover:underline">Regístrate</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
